{"id":"sobstvenno","lemma":"собственно","pos":"adv","rank":2006,"glosses":["as a matter of fact, in fact"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"О чём мы, собственно, говорим?","en":"What are we actually talking about?","words":[{"g":"about"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Что это, собственно, значит?","en":"What does it actually mean?","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"so"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"why"]]},{"text":"Что вы, собственно, хотите этим сказать?","en":"Why, what do you mean?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell"}]},{"text":"Вот, собственно, и всё.","en":"That's all there is to it.","words":[{"g":"here is"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"everything, all"}]},{"text":"Я, собственно, должен был уехать вчера.","en":"I was supposed to leave yesterday.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to go away"},{"g":"yesterday"}]}]}